  "rules": ["One tab bar like this per page; the label on it keeps 4.5:1.", "The pill never shines, folds or streaks: no silk, glass or metal looks, no motion inside it.", "The indicator moves only when a tab is chosen, never on a timer.", "Panels hold real product content, not lorem."],
  "a11y": "ARIA tabs: tablist, tabs with aria-selected and aria-controls, roving tabindex, arrow keys, Home and End; panels are focusable. Reduced motion jumps instead of gliding."
}
