  "moodOnly": "its file names a business or shows another's identifiable room: mood only. Never dealt as the lead, in a trade whose pages hold the client's own room, counter, rooms or product (cafe, hotel, bike, food, shop, farm, wine, bar, bakery, florist, workshop), nor into a section that is the client's premises or work (rooms, bar, workshop, range, studio, visit); only a mood, story or closing section of another trade. Never captioned as the client's",
