  "light": "one line: the light it was taken in; one deal keeps to one light",
  "soft": "soft at the edges, a blown or cluttered ground, or an uneven snapshot that passed the full-size review only just: dealt last, after every sharper frame of its subject (never first in a section), never the lead"
