        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--row">
        <h3>Works inside your helpdesk</h3>
        <p>It picks up tickets in Zendesk, replies and updates the status, like a person on your team.</p>
        <div class="panel panel--device">
          <div class="panel__bar"><span class="ui-agent" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Relay</span><span class="muted">6 open tickets</span><span class="sp"></span><span class="panel__status"><i></i>Running</span></div>
